('20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000320', 'reading', 11, '{"passage": "A well-told story often moves through clear stages. At first, the plan seemed too risky, but the team decided to act without delay. She recognized the danger straightaway and responded quickly. In the end, everything worked out fine, and in the aftermath, the whole team felt proud. In retrospect, it was the right decision.", "translation": "Uma história bem contada geralmente passa por estágios claros. No início, o plano parecia arriscado demais, mas a equipe decidiu agir sem demora. Ela reconheceu o perigo imediatamente e respondeu rapidamente. No final, tudo deu certo, e no rescaldo, toda a equipe se sentiu orgulhosa. Em retrospecto, foi a decisão certa.", "question": "How did the team decide to act, according to the text?", "options": ["Without delay", "Gradually", "In due course"], "correct_index": 0}'),
